mantle rm518
state ready
dialect plain
accent light broad
tier standard
written_for rm_hilde_dripby
title the clean square
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=none honesty=sly
traits temper=short talk=plain warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=sly piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk folds_one_clean_square_from_even_the_worst_rag
likes hard_cheese long_walks new_boots misty_dawns
